    "media:imagetext": "/EAT\nINLAND EMPIRE AIRLINES\nPASSENGER SAFETY INFORMATION\n\"NO SMOKING\" AND \"FASTEN SEAT BELT\" SIGNS\nFor your safety and comfort, please comply with the \"NO SMOKING\" and\n\"FASTEN SEAT BELT\" signs when they are illuminated. Seat belts should\nbe fastened securely. As a precaution against unexpected turbulence you\nshould keep your seat belt fastened at all times while seated.\nMETRO I|\nSWEARINGEN AVIATION CORPORATION\nA Subsidiary of\nFAIRCHILD INDUSTRIES\nOXYGEN\nNO SMOKING ALLOWED\nWHEN OXYGEN IS IN USE.\nTO FASTEN:\nInsert metal. tab into metal buckle until it\nsnaps.\nTO ADJUST:\nPull end of belt until desired secureness is\nobtained.\nTO REMOVE:\nInsert fingers under buckle flange and lift\nupward.\nThe altitudes at which the aircraft operates may\nrequire the use of oxygen in the event there is a loss\nof cabin pressure. Should this occur a crew member\nwill notify you.\n1. Take the mask which is stowed in your seat back\nand promptly insert hose plug into oxygen outlet\nreceptacle located adjacent to seat.\n2. Place mask over your nose and mouth; breathe\nnormally. (\n3. Adjust headband to hold mask snugly.\n4. Wear mask until advised by crew to remove it.\nPLEASE DO NOT REMOVE THIS CARD FROM AIRCRAFT - SEE OTHER SIDE",
